  "caveats": [
    "Raw captures marked _capture.note as 'field-selected' were returned inline and rewritten by hand with every field used downstream retained; the four harness-spooled files (backlink profile pages 1-2, three SERP files, five ranked-keyword files) are byte-for-byte copies.",
