    "get_keyword_metrics returned no volume for many long-tail candidates; those rows are kept in keyword_map.csv with blank volume_estimate and source_note recording that the volume is unmeasured.",
    "current_rank is populated for only 30 of 820 keyword_map rows because the ranked-keyword sets are dominated by long-tail queries that do not appear in the country packages.",
